| **Technical soundness** | Solid: factorial design, randomized insertions, causal claims | Moderate: high variance undermines reliability | High: hundreds of runs, theoretical grounding |
| **Empirical support** | Strong: 8 core + 6 timing + interference/paraphrase models | Strong but high variance | Very strong: hundreds of runs across scales |
| **Significance** | High: privacy/copyright/contamination are pressing concerns | High: security community resource | High: practical LLM training efficiency |
| **Clarity** | Good but missing error bars, limitations section | Generally good but dense tables | Good; some presentation artifacts |

