### Scoring Rationale

The paper is a solid diagnostic study on a timely and important topic. Its most valuable contributions are:
1. Demonstrating the accuracy-robustness mismatch (high static classification accuracy ≠ robust RL training)
2. Systematic adversarial probing that reveals discriminative vs. generative verifier robustness differences
